168
00:55:02,335 --> 00:55:12,115
Evet, tamam. [kişisel bilgi]

169
00:55:23,219 --> 00:55:32,339
Yine [öğrenci] de şey bu.

170
00:55:34,139 --> 00:55:35,259
Merhaba hocam.

171
00:55:35,259 --> 00:55:36,199
